// A line that starts with // is a note to yourself. Tyto ignores it.

// The value on the same line as the directive:
::titulo Open day at the library

// Or on the lines below it, indented:
::subtitulo
  Saturday, 10 am to 4 pm.
  \::free entry is not a directive, because of the backslash.
